id: pm-0qg5
title: "Item-directory fan-out: bucketed storage layout behind format_version gating with a lossless migration"
description: "Filesystem-physics child of pm-9rxu: directories with 100k+ entries degrade badly on most filesystems and in git status. Explicitly blocked on the ADR because the bucket scheme is a one-way door. Duplicate check: pm-ae1u introduced format_version gating (closed) — this builds on it, does not duplicate it."
