acceptance_criteria: "Storage layout supports bucketed subdirectories per ADR pm-bl8x scheme; migration command converts existing flat layouts losslessly (history chains, files links, extensions intact; validate + health green before/after); old layout keeps working read-only until migrated; format_version gates new layout; git history stays diffable per item"
